#only("1")[#voiceover("Let's review the key objectives of Behavioral Finance.")]
#only("2")[#voiceover("First, it aims to identify the common biases that affect investor behavior, such as overconfidence, loss aversion, and herd behavior.")]
#only("3")[#voiceover("Second, it seeks to understand how these biases impact financial markets, potentially leading to market anomalies and inefficiencies.")]
#only("4")[#voiceover("Finally, Behavioral Finance aims to develop strategies to mitigate these biases, helping investors make more rational decisions and potentially improving market efficiency.")]
]

